  "not_vector_loaded": {
    "every launcher": "sinks, scales/norms, codebook, vs, inject, flags: scalar loads",
    "apa_spq1_core spo4 / spo5 / baseline paths (G > 1, or S > 2048 at cap <= 64, dots tensor, baseline dump)": "q, k, kq, v through ld<T> or 16-bit pair loads (tensor.cuh pair16): scalar",
    "apa_spq1_run (packed r2) q, codes, rotation": "spq1::rotate, spq1::bulk and spq1::bulk_shared read scalars",
    "apa_spq1_rotate / apa_spq1_prepare / apa_spq1_pack / apa_eb2b_quantize / apa_spq1_int4_stats": "scalar loads (kernels spq1::rotate, spq1::prepare, spq1::pack_tq, spq1::pack_int4_rows, eb2b::quantize, apa_selective_int4_stats_kernel)",
    "dense production entries (kernels.cu apa_selective_attention_sp and its split-K kernels)": "read-only this round; they accept misaligned operands (REV1 p1rev-3), checked again in LF3"
  },
  "internal": "Vector loads of this launcher's own buffers: the rotated query (float4, spq6.cuh:105, eb3.cuh:258/354, eb4.cuh:133; allocated by apa_spq1_rotate or an arena view), the pa partials (float4, eb3.cuh/eb4.cuh fused merge), shared-memory tiles. Arena views are 16-byte aligned (kArenaAlignment) and fresh allocations are cudaMalloc-aligned."
